    "splat": {},
    "biography": "<p>Eternal Ruler of the Realm, the Scarlet Bride, the Queen of Hell. Once a young Dragon-Blooded officer who seized the Sword of Creation to scour the Fair Folk from the world, she ruled Creation for over seven centuries before being abducted by the Ebon Dragon and bound as his bride. Stats are presented as freewilled ruler / akuma (or enhanced via demonic Endowments) where they differ. She has mastered the Five Dragon, Terrestrial Hero, and White Veil martial arts styles. Thanks to the Mantle of Brigid she is also an accomplished Celestial Circle sorcerer, and as the Queen of Hell (through the Wedding Band of the Scarlet Bride or Investiture of Infernal Glory) she also knows a number of Adamant Circle spells and all Ebon Dragon Charms appropriate to her Essence rating.</p><p><strong>Motivation:</strong> To preserve Creation at all costs. / None (as akuma). (Secondary Urge either way: 'Love, honor and obey the Ebon Dragon,' plus an Intimacy of love toward the Ebon Dragon from the Wedding Band of the Scarlet Bride.)</p><h3>Attacks (reference — add weapon items for roll pipeline)</h3><p>Punch: Speed 6, Accuracy 11/13, Damage 4B, Parry DV 6/7, Rate 3, Tags N. Kick: Speed 5, Accuracy 10/12, Damage 7B, Parry DV 4/5, Rate 2, Tags N. Clinch: Speed 5, Accuracy 10/12, Damage 4B, Parry DV --, Rate 1, Tags C,N,P. Dire Lance (Eye of the Fire Dragon)*: Speed 4, Accuracy 16/21, Damage 15L/16L, Parry DV 8/11, Rate 3, Tags 2,L,R. *This jade dire lance inflicts aggravated damage to Solar Exalts (see Oadenol's Codex, p. 43).</p><h3>Powers</h3><p>The Scarlet Empress knows most Charms for which her Abilities qualify her. Bureaucracy and social Charms (including Integrity) are her highest priorities, followed closely by Occult and Lore. She knows As In the Beginning, all Dynasty-keyword Charms from Dreams of the First Age, The Wind Turns, Blood Speaks to Blood. Martial arts: Five Dragon Style, Terrestrial Hero Style, White Veil Style. As the Queen of Hell, all Ebon Dragon Charms appropriate to her Essence. Spells: Most published Terrestrial Circle spells; Celestial Circle (via Mantle of Brigid). As the Queen of Hell: Adamant Circle spells including Adamant Countermagic, All-Commanding Oversoul Beckoning, Benediction of Archgenesis, Soul-Twisting Defilement Radiance, Total Annihilation.</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Breeding 5. As ruler of the Realm, she has access to the wealth of the greatest empire on the face of Creation, commands tens of thousands of elite soldiers, controls one of the world's greatest spy networks, and otherwise generally has access to almost any Background at 5+.</p><p><em>Original essence pool from source: Personal 32/33 / Peripheral 60/57 (78/75) / Committed 18 motes</em></p><p><em>Source: Return of the Scarlet Empress</em></p>",
